[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1324.95, "timestamp": "00:22:04", "text": "私は、これらの人々はそこで変わると思う。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1327.99, "timestamp": "00:22:07", "text": "それとも回転するのでしょうか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1329.909, "timestamp": "00:22:09", "text": "いつやるべきか知っていたとき、"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1331.397, "timestamp": "00:22:11", "author": "@DinyoFoxy", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/aACLJToYP6FMtiMkCyV12FJchjJLrwy1qzEVqHiZEyFaZdsbRkj-yqg_i_m8eqjYX-fTLgPLCzk=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "ok bye"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1333.19, "timestamp": "00:22:13", "text": "手数料と探査費用は含まれていますか？私"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1333.433, "timestamp": "00:22:13", "author": "@DinyoFoxy", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/aACLJToYP6FMtiMkCyV12FJchjJLrwy1qzEVqHiZEyFaZdsbRkj-yqg_i_m8eqjYX-fTLgPLCzk=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "guys"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1335.19, "timestamp": "00:22:15", "text": "ガチャは100回しか引けません。彼女を捕まえられたといいな。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1338.149, "timestamp": "00:22:18", "text": "こんにちは、カマットさん。幸運を。君ならできるよ。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1338.451, "timestamp": "00:22:18", "author": "@mishereshu", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_mc4Y9gQCEiemTFxftMBzkVs4f2dFVKIi2EzfEXVVougJ-byH1unVlcX4jadECPvzh2lg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "byebyee"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1340.63, "timestamp": "00:22:20", "text": "自分を信じて。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1341.265, "timestamp": "00:22:21", "author": "@mishereshu", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_mc4Y9gQCEiemTFxftMBzkVs4f2dFVKIi2EzfEXVVougJ-byH1unVlcX4jadECPvzh2lg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "have fun"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1342.95, "timestamp": "00:22:22", "text": "ガチャの神様があなたを助けてくれますように。ガチャ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1345.59, "timestamp": "00:22:25", "text": "今夜、神々があなたを助けて"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1357.51, "timestamp": "00:22:37", "text": "どのエリアに行くのか、どうすればわかりますか？"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1363.253, "timestamp": "00:22:43", "aut